{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shouldermen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know the devil on your shoulder?\u00a0 The Shouldermen are those tiny angel and devil doppelgangers that stand on your shoulder giving advice when you are making tough decisions. An evil genius has sparked global chaos by trapping everyone's Shouldermen in secure VR prisons leaving humanity to make decisions at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job? Hack into the VR prisons and help the Shouldermen to escape by getting them to say the password out loud. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay and Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialog Driven Gameplay</strong>: Engage in real-time spoken conversations with the characters to play the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Text Input</strong>: Direct control over what you say. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Word Puzzles</strong>: How will you coax the Shouldermen into saying the password so they can escape.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who Will You Become?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shouldermen isn't just about saving the world. It's about discovering who you are. Your journey through this AI generated labyrinth will leave you reflecting on what makes us human long after you've played. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Generative AI</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game uses generative AI for spoken dialog from Eleven Labs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice recognition is handled by AWS Transcribe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The character dialog is generated using GPT 4o from Open AI.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Answers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2671050/3d3d074ead6fd215fe283a458ebec1b058c1e70f.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Answers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2671050/1a0b9031f68d57a610cb1b37d409daaae1747997.jpg"},{"name":"First Question","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2671050/30e41e8d42c1e77d8d1f5be2fb2e0232314a1ee6.jpg"},{"name":"Asked 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2671050/73c9dcffc98d05975683735c02c66541298bba7d.jpg"},{"name":"Saving Shouldermen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2671050/e279450e6c7fe8dde4e242d8f67945aea6112023.jpg"},{"name":"Tricked the Devil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2671050/b74da7a962958667400675f8cb36712d7e217239.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2671050?t=1743872288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743872288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743872288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743872288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shouldermen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know the devil on your shoulder?\u00a0 The Shouldermen are those tiny angel and devil doppelgangers that stand on your shoulder giving advice when you are making tough decisions. An evil genius has sparked global chaos by trapping everyone's Shouldermen in secure VR prisons leaving humanity to make decisions at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job? Hack into the VR prisons and help the Shouldermen to escape by getting them to say the password out loud. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay and Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialog Driven Gameplay</strong>: Engage in real-time spoken conversations with the characters to play the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Text Input</strong>: Direct control over what you say. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Word Puzzles</strong>: How will you coax the Shouldermen into saying the password so they can escape.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who Will You Become?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shouldermen isn't just about saving the world. It's about discovering who you are. Your journey through this AI generated labyrinth will leave you reflecting on what makes us human long after you've played. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Generative AI</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game uses generative AI for spoken dialog from Eleven Labs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice recognition is handled by AWS Transcribe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The character dialog is generated using GPT 4o from Open AI.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Outdoor Devs"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/header.jpg?t=1743872288","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Outdoor Devs","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257022714,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257022714/movie480.mp4?t=1715556672","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257022714/movie_max.mp4?t=1715556672"},"name":"Anonymous Call To Action","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea